<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">
<head>
  <%== render("templates/head.html.erb") %>
  <%== File.read('templates/pinecone.html') %>
  <!-- Icons: Font Awesome Free 6.7.2 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0) Copyright 2024 Fonticons, Inc. -->
  <link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown" href="<%= site_link("index.md") %>">
  <title>João Pinheiro</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Personal homepage of João Pinheiro" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Personal homepage of João Pinheiro" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="João Pinheiro" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="<%= SITE_ROOT %>" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="profile" />
  <meta property="og:image" content="<%= SITE_ROOT %>/assets/me.webp" />
  <meta property="og:image:alt" content="A picture of João Pinheiro" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
  <meta property="profile:first_name" content="João" />
  <meta property="profile:last_name" content="Pinheiro" />
  <meta property="profile:username" content="pineman" />
  <meta property="profile:gender" content="male" />
  <%== json_ld({
    "@context" => "https://schema.org",
    "@type" => "ProfilePage",
    "url" => "#{SITE_ROOT}/",
    "mainEntity" => {
      "@type" => "Person",
      "name" => "João Pinheiro",
      "alternateName" => "pineman",
      "url" => "#{SITE_ROOT}/",
      "image" => "#{SITE_ROOT}/assets/me.webp",
      "sameAs" => [
        "https://github.com/pineman",
        "https://www.linkedin.com/in/joaocastropinheiro",
        "https://twitter.com/pineman_",
      ],
    },
  }) %>
</head>
<body>
<div id="wrap">
<header id="index-header">
  <div id="index-header-img">
    <img src="assets/me.webp" alt="A picture of me" width="250" height="250" fetchpriority="high" />
  </div>
  <div id="index-header-text">
    <div id="index-header-text-text">
      <h1>Hi! I'm pineman</h1>
      <span>and I like computers</span>
    </div>
    <ul id="index-header-text-links">
      <li>
        <span class="icon-container">
          <%== icon("envelope") %>
        </span>
        <a href="mailto:joaocastropinheiro@gmail.com">joaocastropinheiro<wbr>@gmail.com</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="icon-container">
          <%== icon("file-lines") %>
        </span>
        CV: <a href="<%= site_link("cv/cv.pdf") %>" target="_blank">PDF</a> or <a href="<%= site_link("cv/index.html") %>" target="_blank">HTML</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="icon-container">
          <%== icon("linkedin") %>
        </span>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/joaocastropinheiro" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="icon-container">
          <%== icon("github") %>
        </span>
        <a href="https://github.com/pineman" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="icon-container">
          <%== icon("twitter") %>
        </span>
        <a href="https://twitter.com/pineman_" target="_blank">Twitter</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</header>
<main>
<article>
  <p>Hi! My name is João Pinheiro (aka pineman), I'm from Lisbon, Portugal and I like computers.<!-- I started programming when I was <span title="<%= years_ago("2014-02-01") %> years ago">16</span> with Python and I've loved software ever since.--> Currently at <a href="https://www.amplemarket.com/">amplemarket</a>!</p>
  <h2><a href="<%= site_link("atom.xml") %>"><span class="icon-container"><%== icon("square-rss") %></span>Blog</a></h2>
  <ul>
    <% posts.sort_by(&:date).reverse.each do |post| %>
      <li>
        <time class="index-post-time" datetime="<%= post.date.iso8601 %>"><%= post.date.strftime("%Y-%m-%d") %></time>
        <a href="<%= post.url %>"><%= post.title %></a>
      </li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
  <h2><a href="<%= site_link("links.html") %>"><span class="icon-container"><%== icon("link") %></span>Links</a></h2>
  <h2><a href="<%= site_link("notes.html") %>"><span class="icon-container"><%== icon("note-sticky") %></span>Notes</a></h2>
  <details style="margin-top: -0.5em;">
    <summary><h2 style="display: inline-block;"><span class="icon-container" style="margin-top: -4px; margin-left: 6px;"><%== icon("layer-group") %></span>Projects</h2></summary>
    <ul style="margin-top: 0;">
      <li><a href="https://github.com/pineman/fpt">fpt</a> - Gameboy emulator (rust)</li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/pineman/su">su</a> - Sudoku browser game (ruby)</li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/pineman/abra">abra</a> - Typing speed game (js)</li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/pineman/LEDmatrix">LEDmatrix</a> - A 20 * 10 pixel LED matrix (python)</li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/pineman/r2p">r2p</a> - Play remote games via RDP on a Raspberry Pi (C++, Qt)</li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/pineman/aoc">aoc</a> - Advent of Code solutions</li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/pineman/code">code</a> - Everything else: challenges, old projects, experiments</li>
    </ul>
    Academic selection:
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/pineman/psis">Multithreaded distributed clipboard</a> (C)</li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/pineman/blackjack">Blackjack game</a> (C, SDL2)</li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/pineman/wordmorph">Shortest paths between words</a> (C)</li>
    </ul>
  </details>
</article>
</main>
<footer>
  <a href="https://www.eff.org/" class="img-link"><img src="https://www.eff.org/files/eff-join2_0.png" alt="Join EFF!" width="128" height="128"></a>
  <a href="https://www.fsf.org/" class="img-link"><img src="https://static.fsf.org/nosvn/associate/crm/3217362.png" alt="Join the FSF!" width="180" height="45"></a>
</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
